{"data":{"artifacts":[{"bytes":2161,"filename":"2026-10-14-boiler-replacement-quote-comparison.md","id":"c1ba337b2dd07cab","mime":"text/markdown","sha256":"ee54c38b4da9f45d9bd755090da37cb0e5f5d3d95c9bf96738da7d3ce6089eec"}],"directives":null,"last_reply_ms":1791940050123,"narration":"**Pick Rossi Idraulica: 3,950 EUR total, 10 year warranty, 198 EUR cheaper than TermoCasa.**\n\nReport saved to `vault/Projects/Research/2026-10-14-0305-boiler-replacement-quote-comparison.md` and attached.\n\n| | Rossi Idraulica | TermoCasa |\n|---|---|---|\n| Boiler | Vaillant ecoTEC plus 30 kW | Baxi Duo-tec 28 kW |\n| Total incl. VAT | **3,950 EUR** | 4,148 EUR (3,400 x 1.22) |\n| Warranty | 10 yr, needs yearly service | 5 yr |\n| Can fit | ~28 Oct | ~21 Oct |\n\nWhy Rossi: cheaper, double the warranty, and the service condition costs you nothing since Marta already services your Vaillant every November (next due 2026-11-14). Same brand as the 2019 unit you have now.\n\nThe one loss is speed, roughly a week later. Only worth paying TermoCasa's 198 EUR premium if the current boiler dies first, and it is still losing pressure to 0.8 bar every two weeks.\n\nTwo things to ask before signing: whether 28 kW is enough for the house (the quotes are not like for like on output), and whether Rossi's 10 years covers parts and labour.","provenance":{"badge":"[qwen-local-direct · write · $0.0000]","cost_usd":0.0,"flags":{"citations_unverified":false,"hosted_verify":false,"verify_queued":false},"model":"qwen-local-direct","route":"hosted"},"response":"\n\nAttached as `2026-10-14-boiler-replacement-quote-comparison.md`.\n\n[qwen-local-direct · write · $0.0000]","session_id":"direct-6dc330bf-e60d-406d-89a6-514196d74123"},"event":"done","t_ms":93102,"type":"bridge_sse"}
